Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why did a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:01.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel wall just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.17,0:00:01.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,jump out of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:01.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.23,0:00:02.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.41,0:00:03.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,security barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.77,0:00:04.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,In an emergency
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:05.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,it rises in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.53,0:00:06.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,about a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:07.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Under the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:08.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,a hinged steel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:09.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,plate waits inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:10.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,a concrete pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.85,0:00:12.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hydraulic pistons swing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.19,0:00:12.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,its front edge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:14.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,up, nearly three
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.09,0:00:14.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,feet high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.09,0:00:15.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,A car that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.55,0:00:16.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,hits it doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:16.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,just bounce off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:17.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,the steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:18.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thick struts push
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.67,0:00:19.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,the crash down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.61,0:00:20.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,into tons of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:21.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,buried concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:22.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:23.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,stops dead, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:23.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,its back end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:24.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,flips into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:24.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:25.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tested ones can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:26.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop a fifteen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.79,0:00:27.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,thousand pound truck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.77,0:00:28.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,going fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.69,0:00:29.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's what those
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:30.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,striped steel plates
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:31.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,at secure gates
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:31.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,are for.
